This standalone crate is GPL-2.0-only; it is not part of AirHound's MIT-licensed
core build. Derived files retain source attribution in their headers.

The receiver now links vendored libusb through rusb/libusb1-sys. libusb retains
its LGPL-2.1-or-later terms. Candidate packages include its COPYING file as
LIBUSB-LICENSE, dependency license/notice files, and a separate source archive
with the exact locked dependency sources used to rebuild the executable offline.
These materials do not replace the separate firmware terms below.

USB transport/firmware helper sources: usb.c, mt76x02_usb_core.c,
mt76x02_usb_mcu.c, mt76x0/usb_mcu.c.
